Scaffold a detection objective.

␛[1m␛[4mUsage:␛[0m ␛[1mopentide new objective␛[0m [OPTIONS]

␛[1m␛[4mOptions:␛[0m
      ␛[1m--name␛[0m <NAME>
          Object name; the filename is its slug

      ␛[1m--threat␛[0m <THREAT>
          UUID of a threat this objective addresses (repeatable)

      ␛[1m--path␛[0m <PATH>
          File to write, or a folder to write it in (default: the family's objects folder)

      ␛[1m--help␛[0m
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide new objective --name "Detect Credential Dumping" --threat <threat-uuid>

